&lt;p&gt;📜 &lt;strong&gt;ERRATUM (12.10.2026)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;This entry from 21.05.2026 described Heniu 5.x with two language models. We eliminated the small model: Scout now runs on fixed rules in code, without a model, and a single local model writes the texts. That is why we corrected the description of the architecture and clarified the description of data sources. Heniu-F has also joined: a module on a VPS that aggregates data from official sources and passes it to Heniu in verified packages.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>